  "narrative_premise": "You are Xiao Ming, a skilled but overworked programmer at Megacorp, a company that illegally harvests user data for profit. After discovering a secret project called 'OmniGaze', you must decide whether to expose the truth, collaborate with the system, or lead a revolution from within. Your choices will determine not only your fate but the future of digital society.",
